# pydtcpip credentials for the DTCP-IP rescue tool.
#
# Copy this file to credentials.env (in the data directory) and fill in
# the two values yourself, as hexadecimal strings:
#
#   PYDTCPIP_CERTIFICATE : device certificate (hex)
#   PYDTCPIP_PRIVATE_KEY : per-device private key (hex)
#
# Rules agreed for this tool:
#   - This file is the ONLY place credentials are stored. Never put the
#     values anywhere else (chat, other files, command lines).
#   - The rescue tool itself never reads, prints, or verifies the values;
#     pydtcpip loads this file directly.
#   - Keep the file private: chmod 600 on POSIX, restricted ACL on Windows.
#
# Format reference: pydtcpip Readme (credentials.env / PYDTCPIP_* variables).

PYDTCPIP_CERTIFICATE=
PYDTCPIP_PRIVATE_KEY=
